--- !u!114 &1317045017
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1317045016}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 29c8cba04c3065249b6f51ae1b2c530f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEve.Runtime::UnityEve.Game.StoryDirector
  _texts:
  - Find out what happened to the Mercers. Their house is on Ashgrove Street.
  - Tom Mercer locked a shotgun in the shed. Take it.
  - Survivors were gathering at Saint Ansel's. Head east to the Market Square.
  - The church is barred. Find Frank's spare key at Kingsport Foods, south down Willow
    Lane.
  - Return to Saint Ansel's and get inside.
  - Destroy what waits in the nave.
  _facts:
  - item:key_shed
  - weapon:shotgun
  - flag:church_tried
  - item:key_church
